  "description": "Patricia Stokes Auctioneers & Valuers are delighted to introduce No 1 Tara, Kinsale withing the exclusive new development featuring a selection of 4 and 5 bedroom homes. No 1 has been carefully designed to blend contemporary architecture with exceptional comfort, creating a luxurious coastal lifestyle. It lends itself to effortless family living, with generous and well-planned layouts bathed in natural light and is nestled in a discreet and private setting within the heart of Kinsale.\nAccommodation in brief offers welcoming entrance hall with double height, lounge, open plan kitchen cum dining room, bedroom4, utility room, cloaks press and full family bathroom all at entry level. The first floor is home to the main bedroom suite with walk in dressing room and en suite, two additional double bedrooms, a family bathroom supports the two rooms at this level. \nNo 1 boats an AO energy rating and each floor is thermostatically controlled with underfloor heating on the ground floor and first floor. It enjoys and innovative heat recovery system, providing energy efficient central heating and hot water, at proven reduced energy cost against current market alternatives. It has high performance uPVC double glazed windows and patio doors to private rear gardens.\nThis home enjoys a front garden which is landscaped to a high standard together with generous paved driveway for two cars. The rear of this home backs directly south and is flooded in natural sunlight throughout the day. To the rear there is an extensive limestone terrace running the entire width of the property and accessed directly from the main living spaces. The rear garden is lawned and enclosed and particularly private.\nThis home is part of a development of just 7 detached properties. No 1 along with its counterparts are now complete and ready for purchasers to put their own stamp on it with the finishing touches. A full package is available to would be buyers where the developer (with client engagement) will complete the property to turnkey finish.\nImportant Notice: The images and video featured in this brochure have been enhanced or generated using artificial intelligence (AI) technology. These visuals are intended solely for illustrative and conceptual purposes to demonstrate the property's potential.",
